name: ['Acidic Slime', 'Ancient Grudge', "Avacyn's Pilgrim", 'Despise', 'Dismember', 'Evolving Wilds', 'Forbidden Alchemy', 'Gitaxian Probe', 'Glistener Elf', 'Lingering Souls', 'Pillar of Flame', 'Tectonic Edge']
